{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"一、九年，春王三月丁丑，宋公禦說卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"何以不書葬？為襄公諱也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會宰周公、齊侯、宋子、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯于葵丘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"宰周公者何？天子之為政者也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"三、秋七月乙酉，伯姬卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"此未適人，何以卒？許嫁矣。婦人許嫁，字而笄之，死則以成人之喪治之。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"四、九月戊辰，諸侯盟于葵丘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"桓之盟不日，此何以日？危之也。何危爾？貫澤之會，桓公有憂中國之心，不召而至者江人、黃人也。葵丘之會，桓公震而矜之，叛者九國。震之者何？猶曰振振然。矜之者何？猶曰莫若我也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"五、甲戌，晉侯詭諸卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉里克弒其君之子奚齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_72_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_72","textTraditional":"此未踰年之君，其言弒其君之子奚齊何？殺未踰年君之號也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}